'''Lakeshore''' is a town northeast of [[Sanctuary]], southwest of [[Shrouded Glade]]. It is surrounded mostly by water, and is a good spot for [[Fisherman|fishermen]] to level up. The closest [[Dungeons|dungeon]] to it is [[Robgoblin Treasure Trove]]. It has many activities such as fishing in Rainbow Lake, Lakshore Fields Farming, Checkers & Chess, and Jump Pads.

